WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.933
These patterns are drawn
by vibration.

2
00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:06.100
Scatter sand
on a metal plate,

3
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.600
then make it vibrate
at a resonant frequency.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.367
The moving regions
bounce the grains away.

5
00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:15.867
But some lines stay still.

6
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.967
They're called nodes.

7
00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:20.300
Sand gathers there,

8
00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:23.033
tracing the plate's
pattern of motion.

9
00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:26.333
Change to a different
vibration mode,

10
00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.867
and a different pattern
can appear.

11
00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:32.200
The shape also depends
on the plate

12
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.133
and how it's held.

13
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.533
So the sand isn't showing

14
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:38.700
where the plate moves most.

15
00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:41.433
It's revealing
where it doesn't move.
